不辣非常好吃。\n雞湯酸菜梅花豬，酸菜夠味，湯頭不死鹹，非常開胃，讓人一口接一口停不下來。\n炸豆腐外酥內軟，還帶點咬勁，很值得推薦。\n整體用餐下來，份量十足，用餐環境也很好，很值得推薦給大家嚐鮮唷！",null,[0,116]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12044792938329824252/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrVWxacmRFbFJXRVp3VkVWT1ZGZFhSVFJoUlRsdFkxZGtVbFpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12044792938329824252/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrVWxacmRFbFJXRVp3VkVWT1ZGZFhSVFJoUlRsdFkxZGtVbFpZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12044792938329824252/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrVWxacmRFbFJXRVp3VkVWT1ZGZFhSVFJoUlRsdFkxZGtVbFpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12044792938329824252/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrVWxacmRFbFJXRVp3VkVWT1ZGZFhSVFJoUlRsdFkxZGtVbFpZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12044792938329824252/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrVWxacmRFbFJXRVp3VkVWT1ZGZFhSVFJoUlRsdFkxZGtVbFpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12044792938329824252/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrVWxacmRFbFJXRVp3VkVWT1ZGZFhSVFJoUlRsdFkxZGtVbFpZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2298,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kUlZrdElRWEZwVEVOVFdXRTRhRTltY1dkUlZYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x365380467d0985ba!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOndRVktIQXFpTENTWWE4aE9mcWdRVXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kUlZrdElRWEZwVEVOVFdXRTRhRTltY1dkUlZYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kUlZrdElRWEZwVEVOVFdXRTRhRTltY1dkUlZYYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kUlZrdElRWEZwVEVOVFdXRTRhRTltY1dkUlZYYxILMGRvOUZUWnJGUGMaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uZFJWa3RJUVhGcFRFTlRXV0U0YUU5bWNXZFJWWGMSCzBkbzlGVFpyRlBjIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARuoUJfUaAUzYqCzBkbzlGVFpyR